# Copy to .env.local and fill in.

# LiveKit Cloud development token server id, from the project's Settings page.
#
# This mints join tokens without any backend of our own, which is the only
# reason the web target can run on static hosting today. It is also insecure by
# design: anyone holding the id can issue tokens for the project and join its
# rooms. Fine for a spike — the free tier has no overage, so the worst case is
# that it stops working — but production needs a real token endpoint that keeps
# the API secret server-side.
VITE_LIVEKIT_TOKEN_SERVER_ID=
